
###
# API Collection: Convert to PDF
#
# This file contains example HTTP requests for testing the `/convert-to-pdf` API endpoint.
#
# Purpose:
#   - To convert various supported file types to PDF by providing their file paths.
#
# Usage:
#   - Each section demonstrates a POST request for a different file type.
#   - The API expects a JSON body with a `file` parameter.
#
# Example file types covered:
#   - DOCX, DOC, RTF, ODT, TIFF, TIF
###

### Local variables
@convertToPdfEndpoint = {{host}}/convert-to-pdf

### DOCX: convert docx to PDF
POST {{convertToPdfEndpoint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "file": "{{testFilesPath}}/convert_to_pdf_test_files/docx-file.docx"
}

### RTF: convert rtf to PDF
POST {{convertToPdfEndpoint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "file": "{{testFilesPath}}/convert_to_pdf_test_files/rich-text-format-file.rtf"
}

### ODT: convert odt to PDF
POST {{convertToPdfEndpoint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "file": "{{testFilesPath}}/convert_to_pdf_test_files/opendocument-text-file.odt"
}

### TIFF: convert tiff image to PDF
POST {{convertToPdfEndpoint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "file": "{{testFilesPath}}/convert_to_pdf_test_files/tiff-image-file.tiff"
}

### TIF: convert tif image to PDF
POST {{convertToPdfEndpoint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "file": "{{testFilesPath}}/convert_to_pdf_test_files/tif-image-file.tif"
}